flowchart TD
 S1["1. Confirm strategic and service requirements\nLink the proposed use to a documented priority and a realistic operating model."]
 S2["2. Inventory infrastructure and data assets\nDocument source systems, interfaces, identity, access, compute, storage, provenance, and support."]
 S1 --> S2
 S3["3. Assess interoperability and data fitness\nEvaluate syntactic, semantic, organizational, and temporal interoperability and use-case-specific data quality."]
 S2 --> S3
 S4["4. Assess resilience, security, and technical debt\nReview availability, logging, fallback, recovery, maintainability, and cumulative integration burden."]
 S3 --> S4
 S5["5. Identify readiness gaps and owners\nClassify critical deficiencies, assign remediation, resources, and completion evidence."]
 S4 --> S5
 S6["6. Authorize readiness or restrict ambition\nProceed, remediate, use silent validation, limit scope, or select a non-AI alternative."]
 S5 --> S6
